---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Business Efficiency Apps — Spatialytics"
  description="Custom web applications that reduce overhead for Greater Minnesota businesses. AskBen is the separate consumer product."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mb-12">
        <a href="/solutions" class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline mb-4 inline-block">← All Solutions</a>
        <p class="text-cyan-400 font-medium mb-3 text-sm uppercase tracking-wide">Business Efficiency · B2B</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6 leading-tight">
          Software that reduces overhead and supports better wages
        </h1>
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          Small and mid-sized businesses in Greater Minnesota often run on spreadsheets, paper, and tribal knowledge. Targeted web apps can remove friction and free up capacity. This line is for operators. If you want a household ledger, that is AskBen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="card">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Examples of what we build</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-slate-300 text-sm">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Internal operational dashboards</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Task and workflow systems</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Cost, margin, and financial visibility tools</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Client portals and status tracking</li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="text-cyan-400">•</span> Lightweight CRMs and intake systems</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="card border-amber-500/20">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-3">Not this page</h3>
          <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
            AskBen is a B2C app: a person adds a bill, Ben ranks the next payment. It lives at askben.buzz. Do not pitch it as a shop-floor ERP.
          </p>
          <a href="/solutions/askben" class="text-amber-400 text-sm font-medium hover:underline">Read the AskBen product note →</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="text-center">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Discuss a business app</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
